{"kind":"critique","id":"20260914T210735164Z-141154d5:1","run_id":"20260914T210735164Z-141154d5","timestamp":"2026-09-14T21:07:35.164Z","file_path":"src/services/parlor.ts","spec_path":"src/services/README.md","target_content_hash":"d49f3e3d","spec_content_hash":"549e6f29","reviewer_name":"flash","reviewer_model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","reviewer_hash":"abbf40e9","severity":"error","text":"The spec requires a service module to export exactly one entry point: a function named `run`. This module also exports `formatParlor` and `isEligible`, so it exposes three entry points. The module must export only the single `run` function, with the other functions moved to their own service modules.","mode":"judgment","axiom_id":null,"axiom_version":null,"assigned_by":null,"population":"unknown","authorship":"unknown","authorship_evidence":null,"agent_involved":null,"pre_review":null}
